WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.330
Dhalsim approaches the recovering opponent with Drive Rush.

2
00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:01.780
Drive Rush back heavy kick lands as a Punish Counter.

3
00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.430
Back medium punch follows the close-range heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:03.380
OD Yoga Flame launches the opponent.

5
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.330
Level 2 follows the launcher.

6
00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:05.760
The Level 2 projectile carries the opponent.
